1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,360
A sound soul dwells within a sound mind and a sound body.

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,100
I see a snake in the sky.

3
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:39,940
What are you doing, Rachel?

4
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,640
Your father's waiting for us.

5
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:42,660
We need to get back home.

6
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,380
Did you see it, Mommy?

7
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:46,640
The snake in the sky?

8
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,640
I'm sure it was just a cloud, dear.

9
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,800
That gray one is the one I'm worried about.

10
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:52,220
We might get rain tonight.

11
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,740
Which cloud, Mommy?

12
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:58,540
A puppy!

13
00:00:58,880 --> 00:00:59,320
Wait!

14
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,460
It's probably dirty, honey.

15
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,220
Leave it alone.

16
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:06,800
Hey, puppy, come here!

17
00:01:08,540 --> 00:01:09,640
What's the matter?

18
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:11,800
You're lonely, aren't you?

19
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:20,940
Rachel?

20
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:30,240
Rachel, sweetie?

21
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:36,980
You shouldn't play with stray dogs.

22
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:40,260
Listen to what Mommy said and come away from there.

23
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,900
You don't want to get in trouble, do you?

24
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:45,960
What is it, Rachel?

25
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:49,400
Nothing?

26
00:01:49,940 --> 00:01:50,440
Coming.

27
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:51,400
Sorry, Mommy.

28
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,240
Cheers.

29
00:01:52,260 --> 00:01:52,560
Hey!

30
00:01:52,740 --> 00:01:52,880
Hey!

31
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:55,340
Hi!

32
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:00,940
Marvelous'

33
00:02:00,940 --> 00:02:30,920
Thank you.

34
00:02:30,940 --> 00:02:37,180
Six人目も合わさず運命まで絡んでく

35
00:02:37,180 --> 00:02:43,080
行き先もらったポテル食えない夜の端で

36
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:52,280
不可愛しすぎた眩しさが悪い夢に続いても

37
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:59,600
繋いだ魂の火が胸を刺すなら

38
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:06,360
言葉よりもっと強い響きが今聞こえるか

39
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:11,260
やっとわけは途絶びに引きつけられて

40
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:17,080
触れた瞬間の傷の分だけ確かになれる

41
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:23,840
ご視聴ありがとうございました

42
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:28,840
ご視聴ありがとうございました

43
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:58,820
ご視聴ありがとうございました

44
00:03:58,820 --> 00:04:28,800
ご視聴ありがとうございました

45
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:31,160
Rachel, you've been watching that for a long time

46
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:33,240
don't you think it's about time to turn it off?

47
00:04:34,020 --> 00:04:36,140
always do what your mother tells you

48
00:04:36,140 --> 00:04:39,000
if you're not a good girl, you'll be punished

49
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:48,300
goodnight, mommy

50
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:49,800
I'll see you tomorrow

51
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:52,460
goodnight, Rachel

52
00:04:52,460 --> 00:04:58,540
don't you think Rachel's been acting a little weird today?

53
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:00,260
weird how?

54
00:05:00,260 --> 00:05:02,240
I'm not sure how to explain it

55
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,700
she just seemed kind of off

56
00:05:03,700 --> 00:05:05,820
kids are like that

57
00:05:05,820 --> 00:05:08,220
they change overnight without their parents noticing

58
00:05:08,220 --> 00:05:10,620
I don't think it's anything you need to worry about

59
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:12,260
she's just growing up, that's all

60
00:05:12,260 --> 00:05:12,620
but

61
00:05:12,620 --> 00:05:16,340
you're right

62
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:16,360
you're right

63
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:30,720
what?

64
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:36,440
what happened?

65
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:43,600
mommy, daddy, help

66
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:46,040
I saw a big scary snake

67
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:49,260
it was gonna swallow me up and eat me

68
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:50,780
make it stop

69
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:52,020
a snake

70
00:05:52,020 --> 00:05:54,660
it's okay, sweetie

71
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:56,120
it was just a bad dream

72
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,060
there

73
00:05:57,060 --> 00:05:59,220
you can sleep right here next to daddy, okay?

74
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:02,060
daddy's gonna make all those mean snakes go away

75
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:03,240
isn't that right, mommy?

76
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:04,780
right

77
00:06:04,780 --> 00:06:18,260
medusa's revival

78
00:06:18,260 --> 00:06:20,780
a spider and snake's fateful reunion?

79
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,080
quiet

80
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,300
class is starting

81
00:06:24,300 --> 00:06:26,340
is everybody in their seat?

82
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:29,780
you had us all worried for a while there, Manka

83
00:06:29,780 --> 00:06:31,100
I'm glad the spell's gone

84
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:32,380
and you're back to normal again

85
00:06:32,380 --> 00:06:33,200
mm-hmm

86
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,660
feeling better than ever

87
00:06:34,660 --> 00:06:36,400
ready for a good fight

88
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:36,900
ooh

89
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:39,040
I bet we could have a fight right now

90
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,900
sit down, Patty

91
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:42,920
fine, but can we at least have a party later?

92
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,260
a party in your honor, Maka

93
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:46,080
we can invite Krona, too, if you'd like

94
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,480
yeah, we'll all party together

95
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:49,840
we're missing someone right now, though

96
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,960
let me guess

97
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,540
Blackstar's in yet another fight, Tsubaki?

98
00:06:55,060 --> 00:06:55,720
uh-huh

99
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,240
what a jerk

100
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,080
he goes off to fight and leaves you here?

101
00:06:59,180 --> 00:07:00,320
what's the deal with that guy?

102
00:07:00,540 --> 00:07:01,680
it's how he is

103
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:04,200
Blackstar's a little different from everyone else

104
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:04,940
that's all

105
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:11,440
I'd advise you to cut out the chatter

106
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:14,380
or else next time I won't hit the wall

107
00:07:14,380 --> 00:07:18,160
hey, sorry I'm late

108
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,900
another fight?

109
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:21,400
yeah, it's cool

110
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,740
Miss Marie was the supervisor

111
00:07:22,740 --> 00:07:24,420
and how'd it go?

112
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:27,820
I am the biggest star in this academy

113
00:07:27,820 --> 00:07:30,040
obviously I won

114
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:34,000
winner or loser, you're still late for class

115
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:36,340
you can enjoy yourself out here in the hallway

116
00:07:36,340 --> 00:07:38,080
damn it

117
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:48,800
I have to get stronger

118
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:52,120
what's been getting into Blackstar lately?

119
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:54,220
he's fighting so much

120
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:55,200
yeah, I know

121
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:57,800
ten fights and ten victories without using his weapon

122
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,580
something's up

123
00:07:59,580 --> 00:08:02,700
like I told you all last week

124
00:08:02,700 --> 00:08:04,540
we're going to be starting a new lesson today

125
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:05,600
so I hope you're ready

126
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:07,220
as you know

127
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:09,480
the Kishan's madness has woken the witch Arachne

128
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:11,020
and with her revival

129
00:08:11,020 --> 00:08:12,940
the organization Arachnophobia

130
00:08:12,940 --> 00:08:14,480
is once again active

131
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:17,960
so now it's time to learn about dual arts

132
00:08:17,960 --> 00:08:22,000
it's simpler if I don't explain it in words

133
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,520
this lesson you'll learn by doing, not listening

134
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:27,680
some of you are slower than others

135
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,480
so we'll see

136
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:31,080
he was looking at us when he said that

137
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:34,160
you aren't even really embarrassed, are you?

138
00:08:35,040 --> 00:08:36,260
alright, if I call your name

139
00:08:36,260 --> 00:08:37,940
please step to the front of the classroom

140
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:40,320
first up we have Oxon Harbor

141
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,360
get down here

142
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:43,880
our newly recovered student

143
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,740
Maka

144
00:08:44,740 --> 00:08:45,840
sweet!

145
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:47,540
with soul, of course

146
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:49,140
lastly

147
00:08:49,140 --> 00:08:51,560
Blackstar, get back in here

148
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,980
in or out?

149
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,660
make up your mind already, would ya?

150
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:57,680
uh, why are you all sweaty?

151
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,680
I'm concerned you may destroy the classroom

152
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,680
if you use your weapon for this

153
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,180
so you're on your own

154
00:09:05,180 --> 00:09:06,180
up until this point

155
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:07,820
your training in resonating souls

156
00:09:07,820 --> 00:09:10,480
has been exclusively with your respective partners

157
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,760
but the fact of the matter is

158
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:12,680
you're still kids

159
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:13,980
a single soul resonance

160
00:09:13,980 --> 00:09:15,060
likely won't be enough

161
00:09:15,060 --> 00:09:17,520
against the type of enemy we're facing now

162
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,820
so what I'm going to teach you today

163
00:09:19,820 --> 00:09:20,980
is how to work together

164
00:09:20,980 --> 00:09:22,980
to resonate souls as a team

165
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:25,720
all five of us are supposed to match wavelengths?

166
00:09:26,140 --> 00:09:28,940
I realize this is a new concept for you

167
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:30,640
but give it a try anyway

168
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:32,520
come after me with all you've got

169
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:33,520
already?

170
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:35,140
just like that?

171
00:09:39,140 --> 00:09:40,360
bring it on

172
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,520
I'll dissect you all

173
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:43,700
creepy

174
00:09:43,700 --> 00:09:46,520
hell yeah!

175
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:51,200
where's breakfast, mommy?

176
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:51,860
I'm hungry

177
00:09:51,860 --> 00:09:54,060
yes, I know you are, dear

178
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:56,060
it'll be ready soon

179
00:09:56,060 --> 00:10:00,200
there's plenty left over for seconds

180
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:02,520
it looks so yummy

181
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:13,180
I guess it was my imagination after all

182
00:10:13,180 --> 00:10:24,260
this is the best mother can do

183
00:10:24,260 --> 00:10:28,180
what a pathetically boring and tasteless meal

184
00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:31,880
there's a spider

185
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:34,040
how did that filthy thing get in here?

186
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:37,140
go on, get out now

187
00:10:37,140 --> 00:10:44,580
arachne

188
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:47,980
it didn't take her very long to notice

189
00:10:47,980 --> 00:10:49,520
Rachel, what?

190
00:10:50,340 --> 00:10:50,920
mommy

191
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:54,060
I'm going outside to play

192
00:10:54,060 --> 00:10:57,120
hold it, Rachel

193
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,300
where are you going?

194
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:01,120
a good friend of mine is waiting for me

195
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,420
let go

196
00:11:02,420 --> 00:11:03,760
wait

197
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:05,060
who are you?

198
00:11:05,780 --> 00:11:06,760
you're not Rachel

199
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,920
what a bad mother

200
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,040
treating your own daughter

201
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:11,220
like she's a stranger

202
00:11:11,220 --> 00:11:13,760
she's such a good little girl too

203
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:16,160
and so easily controlled

204
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:19,000
no

205
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:25,940
don't forget to lock the doors and windows

206
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:30,000
if they're open, snakes and spiders will get in

207
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,640
we don't want that

208
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:33,760
bye-bye, mommy

209
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:39,200
Rachel!

210
00:11:49,000 --> 00:12:02,600
I have no idea how this is done

211
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,200
do you?

212
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:04,600
no clue

213
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,860
but Stein's not messing around this time

214
00:12:06,860 --> 00:12:09,000
we're just going to have to figure something out

215
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:12,480
let's go

216
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:15,140
I still don't see how we're supposed to match wavelengths with these guys

217
00:12:15,140 --> 00:12:15,660
but okay

218
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:28,520
die

219
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:30,320
you mad scientist wacko

220
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:34,520
for a freak

221
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:37,300
anybody else want in on the fun?

222
00:12:37,920 --> 00:12:39,120
don't overthink it

223
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,340
it won't do you any good

224
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:43,500
I can barely think at all with this many people watching us

225
00:12:43,500 --> 00:12:44,940
damn you

226
00:12:44,940 --> 00:12:47,340
all right

227
00:12:47,340 --> 00:12:48,560
my turn

228
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:54,620
royal thunder

229
00:12:54,620 --> 00:13:01,360
you are the death wish

230
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:03,240
hey man, it's your own fault

231
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:05,100
you're the one who jumped in front of my attack

232
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:06,000
move it

233
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:12,680
maca

234
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:15,880
you damn idiot

235
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:16,500
my bad

236
00:13:16,500 --> 00:13:17,500
sorry, black star

237
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:20,460
royal thunder

238
00:13:20,460 --> 00:13:28,380
how pathetic

239
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:32,620
that was even worse than I'd expected

240
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:35,120
I'm done with this

241
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:39,000
professor, I'm going to beat the crap out of Ox now

242
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,540
will you act as fight supervisor?

243
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:43,100
save your fighting for after class

244
00:13:43,100 --> 00:13:44,820
whatever you say, professor

245
00:13:44,820 --> 00:13:47,620
but black star and I are going to have to settle this eventually

246
00:13:47,620 --> 00:13:49,580
why do I bother?

247
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:53,520
do you think you stand a chance against the royal thunder commander?

248
00:13:53,520 --> 00:14:02,860
that makes 11 straight victories for black star

249
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:06,100
but is it really a victory if your opponent was that pathetic?

250
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:10,240
I asked them to work together and they beat each other up instead

251
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:11,560
so much for that

252
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:14,620
even if we had all the time in the world

253
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:16,020
it still may not be enough

254
00:14:16,020 --> 00:14:18,180
they don't seem to get it

255
00:14:18,180 --> 00:14:22,520
what do you think Lord Death's reason is

256
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:24,280
for keeping the book of Abon in the vault

257
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:26,820
if he wanted us to know

258
00:14:26,820 --> 00:14:27,980
he would have told us

259
00:14:27,980 --> 00:14:29,020
let it go

260
00:14:29,020 --> 00:14:37,160
this is Lord Death's personal collection

261
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:40,520
there's some pretty frightening stuff down here

262
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:53,420
now there's no need to be shy

263
00:14:53,420 --> 00:14:55,280
go ahead and drink it up

264
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:57,520
a glass of fresh blood should do the trick

265
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:59,220
thank you

266
00:14:59,220 --> 00:15:01,060
it's an honor Lady Arachne

267
00:15:01,060 --> 00:15:03,960
of course it might be poisoned

268
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:09,700
I'm joking

269
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:11,980
we can't kill you quite yet

270
00:15:11,980 --> 00:15:14,040
unfortunately we have to keep you around

271
00:15:14,040 --> 00:15:15,920
if we want to get the book of Abon back

272
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:24,220
forgive me my lady

273
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:26,140
the plans for the magic tool were lost

274
00:15:26,140 --> 00:15:27,500
because of my incompetence

275
00:15:27,500 --> 00:15:30,020
you can make it up to me by doing better

276
00:15:30,020 --> 00:15:31,020
next time mosquito

277
00:15:31,020 --> 00:15:33,920
anyway at least one good thing came of your failure

278
00:15:33,920 --> 00:15:35,980
we were able to test Mifune's abilities

279
00:15:35,980 --> 00:15:36,780
yes

280
00:15:36,780 --> 00:15:39,860
and I believe we'll be able to put his power to good use

281
00:15:39,860 --> 00:15:44,960
is that your big plan

282
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:48,500
what good are you if that's the only thing you can come up with

283
00:15:48,500 --> 00:15:52,840
I suggest you watch your tone with me

284
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:55,140
got it chainsaw boy

285
00:15:55,140 --> 00:16:01,080
my chains are getting dull

286
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:03,300
maybe I should sharpen them on your body old man

287
00:16:03,300 --> 00:16:05,080
just try it

288
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:08,720
I'll drain every drop of blood from your body

289
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,640
until you're an empty sack of skin

290
00:16:10,640 --> 00:16:15,140
police stinger

291
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:24,000
yeah fly away little bug

292
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:32,900
that's all you can do

293
00:16:32,900 --> 00:16:34,560
I hate to break it to you

294
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:35,800
but you're past your prime

295
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:44,720
then maybe you'd like to take a look at my form from 800 years ago

296
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:48,040
this is my three teeth police stinger

297
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:53,220
there's nothing better than reclaiming lost youth is there

298
00:16:53,220 --> 00:16:55,520
shall I snap a picture for you

299
00:16:55,520 --> 00:16:57,080
what do you say

300
00:16:57,080 --> 00:17:02,980
of course it'll be an awkward portrait with you cut up into little bits and all

301
00:17:02,980 --> 00:17:04,820
you young

302
00:17:04,820 --> 00:17:16,820
lady arachne

303
00:17:16,820 --> 00:17:23,520
yes what is it now

304
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:26,660
there's a guest waiting to see you

305
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:31,020
a guest who is it

306
00:17:31,020 --> 00:17:36,560
forgive me lady arachne but she keeps insisting that she's your little sister

307
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:38,060
I see

308
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:40,000
very well

309
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:42,120
show her in

310
00:17:42,120 --> 00:17:52,580
my my look at you

311
00:17:52,580 --> 00:17:57,660
what an adorable body you found this time Medusa

312
00:17:57,660 --> 00:18:15,860
how sweet that you still remember me after 800 long years

313
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:21,920
how could I forget you I always make sure to keep you in my sights no matter how many centuries pass

314
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:26,020
it seems you're still as good as by as ever arachne

315
00:18:26,020 --> 00:18:28,120
you haven't changed a bit either

316
00:18:28,120 --> 00:18:32,520
still barging in here without warning not showing an ounce of fear

317
00:18:32,520 --> 00:18:34,500
you'll never learn will you

318
00:18:34,500 --> 00:18:37,560
not even in that dreadful new form you have

319
00:18:37,560 --> 00:18:40,360
oh but you can get away with a lot in this body

320
00:18:40,360 --> 00:18:43,160
I find your determination truly inspiring

321
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:46,920
you were badly hurt during that fight at the academy

322
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:51,000
your soul was torn into pieces but here you stand alive and well

323
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:58,360
I knew there was one thing I had to avoid at any cost at no point could I allow Stein and Deathscythe to swallow my soul

324
00:18:58,360 --> 00:19:08,060
when I took that final blow I split my soul into pieces entered a snake and repaired myself so that I could return once more

325
00:19:08,060 --> 00:19:13,060
that was a dangerous move even for a powerful witch like yourself

326
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:15,520
you survived out of sheer luck

327
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:17,060
you're probably right

328
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:21,720
the revival of the Kishin Asherah caused the release of strong madness wavelengths

329
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:24,580
my magic was able to feed off of their power

330
00:19:24,580 --> 00:19:27,980
it's likely I wouldn't survive that again

331
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:31,640
so what brings you here Medusa

332
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:36,820
I fought the grim reaper 800 years ago until at the very end of the battle

333
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:38,440
someone betrayed me

334
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:43,040
you think you can just drop in here and leave again without paying a price

335
00:19:43,040 --> 00:19:46,060
it's silly to cling to the past like that

336
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:48,140
the two of us should be friends

337
00:19:48,140 --> 00:19:51,940
we're a pair of newly revived sisters after all

338
00:19:57,980 --> 00:20:13,380
how thoughtful a surprise party to welcome me back to the world

339
00:20:13,380 --> 00:20:16,980
but it's so sudden and I'm afraid I'm no good at parties

340
00:20:16,980 --> 00:20:20,640
I'll see you again soon though dear sister of mine

341
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:25,020
she always was an obnoxious girl

342
00:20:25,020 --> 00:20:28,180
I'll see her out my lady

343
00:20:28,180 --> 00:20:37,180
are you sure about her I'll let her play her games for a while

344
00:20:37,180 --> 00:20:41,720
in the end she'll be caught in my web like everybody else

345
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:49,040
you can't just show up here like that whenever you want to Medusa

346
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:51,820
if you're not careful you're going to get me discovered

347
00:20:51,820 --> 00:20:56,680
you'll continue surveillance as instructed as that understood Erica

348
00:20:56,680 --> 00:20:58,420
yes ma'am

349
00:20:58,420 --> 00:21:02,920
I thought after this she'd finally let me go

350
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:06,700
freedom always comes at a price

351
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:10,040
so uh what are you going to do now

352
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:12,620
I'm borrowing this

353
00:21:12,620 --> 00:21:16,460
I have to retrieve something precious that I left behind

354
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:19,460
in Death City

355
00:21:19,460 --> 00:21:49,440
I'll see you next time

356
00:21:49,440 --> 00:22:02,860
Music

357
00:22:06,860 --> 00:22:13,720
Music

358
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:16,580
行けるはずだろう

359
00:22:16,580 --> 00:22:21,120
穢れなく光が闇を貫いて

360
00:22:21,120 --> 00:22:25,240
この時が永遠だと今命が叫んでる

361
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:29,160
この心の奥にいつも君が映るよ

362
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:33,080
守るべき真実をただ抱いてゆけ

363
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:37,160
繰り返す毎日のパロナミに飲まれても

364
00:22:37,160 --> 00:22:41,120
まだ夢から覚める 俺たちはここにいる

365
00:22:41,120 --> 00:22:45,120
いつも聞こえてくる 仲間たちの声が

366
00:22:45,120 --> 00:22:47,780
孤独を振り払うように

367
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:50,520
街の風の中

368
00:22:50,520 --> 00:22:52,860
ただ行くしかないさ

369
00:22:52,860 --> 00:22:56,160
信じた生き様を

370
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:59,560
あー!

371
00:23:06,620 --> 00:23:09,760
Maka here. Next week, Kid and the others get in big trouble.

372
00:23:09,760 --> 00:23:13,060
Medusa here. As you can see, due to popular demand, I've returned.

373
00:23:13,140 --> 00:23:14,140
I like studying.

374
00:23:14,220 --> 00:23:15,440
I like experiments.

375
00:23:15,520 --> 00:23:16,720
I do the maka chop.

376
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:18,360
I lie and hurt people a lot.

377
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:22,140
It may be hard to believe, but next week you'll see we have something in common.

378
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:24,100
Um, how should we put this?

379
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:26,660
Neither of us is in the next episode.

380
00:23:26,740 --> 00:23:30,400
On the next episode of Soul Eater, the red-hot runaway express.

381
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:33,120
A magic tool left behind by the great wizard.

382
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:35,540
Watch it, or I'll take your soul.

